<title>JAPAN: Tokyo-Mitsubishi -96/97 group results(SEC).</title>
<headline>Tokyo-Mitsubishi -96/97 group results(SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     2.95 trln	 vs	    3.46 trln</p>
<p> Pretax		87.16		vs	  126.13</p>
<p> Net		   32.33		vs	   44.28</p>
<p> EPS		    6.94 yen	  vs	    9.39 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd is a major bank resulting from the merger of former Bank of Tokyo Ltd and former Mitsubishi Bank Ltd, as of April 1, 1996. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
